#metadata(title = "Mote CJK Line Breaking", author = "Mote")

#document(
  default_font = "cjk",
  default_size = pt(11),
  page = { size = "letter" },
  margin = { top = pt(54), right = pt(72), bottom = pt(54), left = pt(72) }
)

#font(
  name = "cjk",
  latin = "Arial Unicode MS",
  east_asian = "Arial Unicode MS",
  word_line_height = 1.7454545,
  files = {
    regular = "/System/Library/Fonts/Supplemental/Arial Unicode.ttf",
    bold = "/System/Library/Fonts/Supplemental/Arial Unicode.ttf",
    italic = "/System/Library/Fonts/Supplemental/Arial Unicode.ttf",
    bold_italic = "/System/Library/Fonts/Supplemental/Arial Unicode.ttf"
  }
)

# CJK Line Breaking

This fixture checks Unicode line-break opportunities for spaceless Chinese and Japanese text. PDF and PNG should stay inside each frame without placing closing punctuation at the start of a line or opening punctuation at the end.

## Natural Paragraph

天地玄黄，宇宙洪荒。日月盈昃，辰宿列张。寒来暑往，秋收冬藏。閏餘成歲，律呂調陽。雲騰致雨，露結為霜。

## Narrow Framed Text

#table(
  width = inch(5.75),
  layout = "fixed",
  alignment = "center",
  cell = {
    margin = { all = pt(7) },
    borders = { all = { style = "single", size = 6, color = "#94a3b8" } }
  }
)[
  #row[
    #cell(width = inch(2.875), fill = "#f8fafc")[
      **Chinese punctuation**

      天地玄黄，宇宙洪荒。日月盈昃，辰宿列张。天地（**玄黄**）宇宙《洪荒》日月「盈昃」辰宿。
    ]
    #cell(width = inch(2.875), fill = "#f8fafc")[
      **Japanese punctuation**

      日本語の文章では、句読点が行頭に置かれず、「**括弧**」も正しくまとまります。長い文章でも自然な位置で改行します。
    ]
  ]
]

## Latin Regression

Ordinary Latin words remain whitespace-delimited, while exceptionallylongunbrokenidentifierstillusestheexistingemergencygraphemefallback0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz only splits when it is wider than the frame.
